      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ALOT LIKE PENDLES (1) resumes from a spell of five months after closing off last campaign in good form, scoring at his last appearance over 1680m at Launceston. A nice draw on the front line should ensure a cosy run. Likely to run a big race to kick off this campaign. OUR ULTIMATE GRACY NZ (4) turned in a much better run at her latest appearance when successful over 1609m at this track, getting home by 5 metres after leading. This looks a sterner test than last time but she is capable of another big performance. CHEYS ANGEL (7) is flying at present with two successive wins to her name, most recently at Launceston a week ago. Big chance to keep the ball rolling. COUNTY COURT JUDGE (2) ended last prep with a fourth at Tamworth over 1980m three-and-a-half months ago. Capable of a forward showing while fresh.",
